        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Sunburnt Egos",
        "Location": "LOCATION_OPULENT_STINGRAY",
        "PublicId": "126450062551",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2cd8e09c-cf30-4ecb-b683-453aa797149d).Image",
        "Description": "Just another ordinary day in the Maldives again. \rSome people sip cocktails, while others decide the fates of others. Four of our guests were acting as if they owned the entire resort. A client asked us to remind them what a little modesty looks like. It’s easy when you’re dressed in resort wear. \rThe key is to maintain the look of a vacationer who has simply stepped out for a stroll along the beach to the bar.\r\r\rCreated by JackMpaint",
